# .env.example
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in any values needed for your environment.
# .env.local is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# This project has no required environment variables for local development.
# All production secrets (e.g. email, analytics) are managed via Netlify
# environment variables in the hosting dashboard.
#
# Example (add real keys only in .env.local or the Netlify dashboard):
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=
